{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703150/extras/Cabe\u00e7alho_da_biblioteca.png?t=1748530991\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enter a forgotten</strong> world where echoes of the past shape the way you see the world! Revella is a story-driven indie RPG adventure created with RPG Maker, where you play as Aveline who awakens in her home after a night she can\u2019t remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the truth behind your identity as you explore vibrant pixel art landscapes, meet quirky villagers, and confront creatures that challenge your sanity. With combat featuring unique enemy behaviors and an engaging narrative, Revella is a journey of memories, dreams, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703150/extras/Village.png?t=1748530991\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious and thrilling narrative!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro JRPG combat with improvements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique enemy designs and boss encounters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charming handcrafted pixel art!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NPCs with stories that shape the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A haunting soundtrack!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703150/extras/Aveline_Andando.gif?t=1748530991\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revella is being developed by Narrativa Studios, a Brazillian studio created by Herv.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703150?t=1748530991","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703150/91a77f5a5678de40c6a004dc33eaf11a682543da/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748530991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703150/ed1605f33c28dfb74ae47d45f366d6cf046ccd5a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748530991","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703150/ed1605f33c28dfb74ae47d45f366d6cf046ccd5a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748530991","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3703320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703150/extras/Revella_Roadmap.png?t=1748530991\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Release</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>We are at this stage!</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chapter 0 released;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feedback round open on Discord;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Updates scheduled through Chapter 2 (Currently on Chapter 0).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Starting after the last update of our demo!</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Implementation of new chapters;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New combat system, items, followers and skills;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Side quests and optional narrative paths;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New enemies and bosses;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New areas and sub-areas.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Full Release</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This is the phase where we will collect all the feedback on our demo and on our Discord server to bring you the full Revella experience!</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full release with all chapters;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some post-launch bug fixes and improvements!</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703150/extras/Cabe\u00e7alho_da_biblioteca.png?t=1748530991\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enter a forgotten</strong> world where echoes of the past shape the way you see the world! Revella is a story-driven indie RPG adventure created with RPG Maker, where you play as Aveline who awakens in her home after a night she can\u2019t remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the truth behind your identity as you explore vibrant pixel art landscapes, meet quirky villagers, and confront creatures that challenge your sanity. With combat featuring unique enemy behaviors and an engaging narrative, Revella is a journey of memories, dreams, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703150/extras/Village.png?t=1748530991\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious and thrilling narrative!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro JRPG combat with improvements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique enemy designs and boss encounters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charming handcrafted pixel art!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NPCs with stories that shape the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A haunting soundtrack!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703150/extras/Aveline_Andando.gif?t=1748530991\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revella is being developed by Narrativa Studios, a Brazillian studio created by Herv.</p>","developers":["Narrativa Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703150/996dc684b37ec7006ed90297acc1d57d0a47bdd3/header.jpg?t=1748530991","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257141840,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141840/movie480.mp4?t=1747764830","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141840/movie_max.mp4?t=1747764830"},"name":"Revella | Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257141840/5500b119b1097fe8e7472372635c923b5712d015/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747764830","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141840/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747764830","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141840/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747764830"}}],"name":"Revella","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (32/64bits)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Pentium\u00ae 4 2.0 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 support<br></li><li><strong>